{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1580"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge belief/mythology","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/belief__mythology.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",1008],["+","Snorri's Prose Edda, written around 1220–1225, explains that this is why Odin knows so much: the two ravens bring him every piece of news they see and hear. "],["=",213]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",966],["+","Snorris um 1220–1225 verfasste Prosa-Edda erklärt, dass Odin deshalb so viel weiß: Die beiden Raben bringen ihm jede Neuigkeit, die sie sehen und hören. "],["=",203]]}]},
