{"seq":39,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"created","target":{"type":"fact","id":"f28513"},"reason":"New question on Geri and Freki, Odin's wolves and the natural partner of his ravens, missing from the article on his household; verified on Wikipedia's Geri and Freki article (names meaning 'the greedy one'; in Grímnismál and Gylfaginning Odin gives them all his food and lives on wine alone; in Helgakviða Hundingsbana they roam the field greedy for corpses).","by":"fact-count-rework","sources":[{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Geri_and_Freki"},{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gr%C3%ADmnism%C3%A1l"}],"changes":[{"field":"answerEn","new":"Geri and Freki"},{"field":"answerDe","new":"Geri und Freki"},{"field":"answerRu","new":"Гери и Фреки"},{"field":"spans","new":{"en":[2611,14],"de":[2844,14],"ru":[2594,12]}},{"field":"timeline","new":{"kind":"creation","start":"1270","end":null,"precision":"decade","approx":true,"ongoing":false,"labelEn":"The Codex Regius preserves the „Grímnismál“, in which Odin feeds Geri and Freki","labelDe":"Der Codex Regius bewahrt die „Grímnismál“, in denen Odin Geri und Freki füttert","labelRu":"Королевский кодекс сохраняет «Речи Гримнира», где Один кормит Гери и Фреки"}},{"field":"source","new":{"url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Geri_and_Freki","title":"Geri and Freki – Wikipedia","lang":"en"}}],"hash":"cd644cef9209"},
{"seq":40,"at":"2026-10-23","kind":"created","target":{"type":"wording","id":"w27513"},"reason":"Open question for the new fact: New question on Geri and Freki, Odin's wolves and the natural partner of his ravens, missing from the article on his household; verified on Wikipedia's Geri and Freki article (names meaning 'the greedy one'; in Grímnismál and Gylfaginning Odin gives them all his food and lives on wine alone; in Helgakviða Hundingsbana they roam the field greedy for corpses).","by":"fact-count-rework","changes":[{"field":"en","new":"What are the two wolves called to whom Odin gives all the food from his table, since he himself lives on wine alone?"},{"field":"de","new":"Wie heißen die beiden Wölfe, denen Odin alles Essen von seinem Tisch gibt, weil er selbst allein vom Wein lebt?"},{"field":"ru","new":"Как зовут двух волков, которым Один отдаёт всю еду со своего стола, ведь сам он живёт одним вином?"},{"field":"origin","new":"generated"},{"field":"fact","new":"f28513"}],"hash":"e6d04e005ce9"},
